# The sdist must carry the build-time catalog generator so that building the wheel FROM the sdist
# (python -m build's default build-via-sdist) can regenerate catalog.sqlite from the committed seed.
# setup.py's CatalogBuildingBuildPy loads this exact path (scripts/catalog/build_catalog_db.py) at
# build time; the seed itself ships as spendguard package-data. The generated catalog.sqlite is a
# disposable build artifact and is intentionally NOT shipped in the sdist (it is gitignored).
include scripts/catalog/build_catalog_db.py
